    {
      "id": "puzzles",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 164,
      "text": "## Puzzles\n\n- **Floor 4, the ear.** Mirror puzzles and sound puzzles throughout.\n- 🔧 Candidate home for [[Penrose Stair]]'s unplaced persona-duplicate gimmick, at no slot cost.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mazepocket",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 434,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 164,
      "text": "## Maze / pocket\n\n- The **twin maze** — [[Maze Family]] variant, after the paired antagonist in *Sayonara Wild Hearts*: never in the same place at the same time. 🔧 Optical and mechanical design.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cutscenes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 216,
      "text": "## Cutscenes\n\n- The room-swap: Otto wakes in [[The Ward]] *as* [[Room 202]], awake.\n- **The psychiatric hospital** — chapter ends with Otto in a gown or straitjacket, locked in a ward. A second-layer dream beneath the dream. The fear is that he is not a detective. See [[The Delusions]].",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "npcdialogue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 276,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## NPC dialogue\n\n- [[Leon]] and [[Noel]] formally.\n- [[Pip]] becomes visible in [[The Cafeteria]] from here on, with a milkshake or an ice cream."
    },
